 "perceived_simulation": "[Messages]\n[learner]: Okay, I see what you mean about adding the mechanism and not just saying \"prints too much money.\"\n\nHow about this version:\n\n\"One main cause of inflation is when the government or central bank increases the money supply faster than the economy’s output, so more money chases the same amount of goods and services and prices go up.\"\n\nDo you think that’s a solid one-sentence answer for this question, or is it still missing something important?",
